%% title: Buying and retiring credits
%% subtitle: The server only moves tokens after reading the payment or request back from the mirror node, and only once.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor B as Buyer wallet
  participant App as GreenTrace server
  participant C as GreenTraceExchange
  participant M as Mirror node
  participant H as Hedera (HTS, HCS)
  participant S as Scheduled scan

  B->>App: Create order (listing, tonnes)
  App->>App: Fix HBAR price, reserve stock atomically
  App-->>B: orderRef, exact amount
  B->>C: purchase(orderRef) with HBAR
  Note over C: Rejects a reused orderRef, forwards the HBAR<br/>to the treasury, emits CreditsPurchased
  par browser confirms
    B->>App: Confirm with tx hash
  and if the tab closed
    S->>App: Every minute (Supabase pg_cron)
    App->>M: New contract events since the cursor
  end
  App->>M: Read tx: contract, event, orderRef, payer, amount
  App->>App: Claim order (only one caller wins)
  App->>H: Transfer CO2e tokens, CREDITS_PURCHASED
  B->>C: requestRetirement(tonnes, certificateId)
  App->>M: Verify event and the owner's linked wallet
  App->>H: Wipe tokens (removed from total supply), CREDITS_RETIRED
  App-->>B: Certificate partially offset or offset
